[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528141630","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923#issuecomment-528141630","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923","id":528141630,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyODE0MTYzMA==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-05T00:13:52Z","updated_at":"2019-09-05T00:13:52Z","body":"Thank you @bzg for submitting this! I see the plain text of the submitted license is in the request entry at http://13.57.134.254/app/license_requests/50/\r\n\r\nI (and others) will review the license text more closely, but a couple of initial questions come to mind:\r\n\r\n* Is \"Open License 2.0\" the license name? If you're affiliated with the license steward, it would be ideal if a more specific name could be used to refer to the license. \"Open License\" is pretty general and might confuse people (as pretty much every license on the License List is an \"open license\"!)\r\n\r\n* Do you know of examples where this license is being used in the wild? One of the factors that the team looks at, when evaluating whether to add a license, is whether it is currently in use for multiple projects. See [here](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/master/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md) for more details about the team's license inclusion principles at present.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528141630/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528141872","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923#issuecomment-528141872","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923","id":528141872,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyODE0MTg3Mg==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-05T00:14:58Z","updated_at":"2019-09-05T00:14:58Z","body":"Sorry, one additional question:\r\n\r\n* Is this English version the \"official\" version of the license text? Or is there a French version that is the canonical license text?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528141872/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528261771","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923#issuecomment-528261771","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923","id":528261771,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyODI2MTc3MQ==","user":{"login":"bzg","id":63500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-05T08:37:29Z","updated_at":"2019-09-05T08:37:29Z","body":"Hi Steve,\n\nthanks for the prompt feedback!\n\nSteve Winslow <notifications@github.com> writes:\n\n> I (and others) will review the license text more closely, but a\n> couple of initial questions come to mind:\n>\n>     Is \"Open License 2.0\" the license name? If you're affiliated with\n>     the license steward, it would be ideal if a more specific name\n>     could be used to refer to the license. \"Open License\" is pretty\n>     general and might confuse people (as pretty much every license on\n>     the License List is an \"open license\"!)\n\nYes, \"open license 2.0\" is the real name.  I know it is a bad name.\nIt is sometimes called by reusers the \"Etalab license 2.0\", because\nEtalab is the name of the mission who publishes it.\n\nI will ask my colleagues what they think about using \"Etalab license\"\nas the name for a SPDX identifier, with etl-2.0 for short.  Or maybe\nthe \"Etalab Open License\" and eol-2.0.  (Let me know if you think one\nis clearly better.)\n\n>     Do you know of examples where this license is being used in the\n>     wild? One of the factors that the team looks at, when evaluating\n>     whether to add a license, is whether it is currently in use for\n>     multiple projects. See here for more details about the team's\n>     license inclusion principles at present.\n\nThe license is used by the whole open data ecosystem in France.\n\nhttps://www.data.gouv.fr/fr/datasets/referentiel-de-lorganisation-administrative-de-letat/\nhttps://www.data.gouv.fr/fr/datasets/boamp/\n\nThere are more than +2k organizations (from small cities to big\nministries) using it right now.\n\nIt is also used by french administrations to publish documents. See\nfor example the french open source policy for the public sector here:\n\nhttps://github.com/DISIC/politique-de-contribution-open-source/blob/master/README.en.md\n\nLet me know if you need more examples.\n\nBest,\n\n-- \n Bastien\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528261771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528262297","html_url":"htt