vatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-06T16:35:45Z","updated_at":"2019-09-06T16:35:45Z","body":"I just validated this with our legal team: we can proceed with \"Etalab Open License 2.0\" and \"etalab-2.0\". Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/528924974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/533138065","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923#issuecomment-533138065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923","id":533138065,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzMzEzODA2NQ==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-19T13:46:12Z","updated_at":"2019-09-19T13:46:12Z","body":"Thank you @bzg! I've updated the title of this issue to reflect the change. I'll follow up in a separate comment below with my thoughts on whether the license should be added to the list.\r\n\r\nUpdated submission request details will be:\r\n\r\n1. License Name: Etalab Open License 2.0\r\n2. Short identifier: etalab-2.0\r\n3. License Author or steward: Etalab (French mission for open data : https://www.etalab.gouv.fr)\r\n4. Comments: The license has not been submitted to OSI because it is mainly targetting open data, not open source.\r\n\r\nIf modications are required, please let me know.\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n5. Standard License Header:\r\n6. URL: https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/open-licence.pdf\r\n7. OSI Status: Not Submitted","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/533138065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/533143609","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923#issuecomment-533143609","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923","id":533143609,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzMzE0MzYwOQ==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-19T13:58:56Z","updated_at":"2019-09-19T13:58:56Z","body":"I think this license is appropriate to add to the license list. I believe it meets the current license inclusion principles, and per @bzg's comments above it is evidently widely used by the French government.\r\n\r\nMy main question is for others on the SPDX team: according to the comments above, it appears that the French version is the \"canonical\" license text, and the English version is provided for convenience:\r\n* French: https://github.com/DISIC/politique-de-contribution-open-source/blob/master/LICENSE.pdf\r\n* English: https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/wp-content/uploads/2018/11/open-licence.pdf\r\n\r\nLooking to what SPDX has done in the past:\r\n* For [CECILL-1.0](https://spdx.org/licenses/CECILL-1.0.html), only the French version was authoritative (see [here](https://cecill.info/faq.en.html#francais-anglais)). On the SPDX list we used the French text, and added a note with the URL to the English translation.\r\n* For later CeCILL versions such as [CECILL-2.1](https://spdx.org/licenses/CECILL-2.1.html), the license steward says that they are deemed equally valid and interchangeable. On the SPDX list we used the English text, and added a note with the URL to the French version.\r\n\r\nGiven all of that, I'm inclined to say that here for etalab-2.0, we should follow the same pattern as CECILL-1.0: add the French version, with a note providing the link to the English translation.\r\n\r\n@jlovejoy @bradleeedmondson or others -- would you agree?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/533143609/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/533144171","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923#issuecomment-533144171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923","id":533144171,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzMzE0NDE3MQ==","user":{"login":"bzg","id":63500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-19T14:00:17Z","updated_at":"2019-09-19T14:00:17Z","body":"> Given all of that, I'm inclined to say that here for etalab-2.0, we should follow the same pattern as CECILL-1.0: add the French version, with a note providing the link to the English translation.\r\n\r\nFWIW, agreed. Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/533144171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/535496424","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923#issuecomment-535496424","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/923","id":535496424,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNTQ5NjQyNA==","user":{"login":"bzg","id":63500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-26T13:14:27Z","updated_at":"2019-09-26T13:14:27Z","body":"Hi all, is there anything I can do to help moving forward with this? Or any hint on how long the validation process could be? I don't want to rush anyone, this is just to l